                            "29 Oct–2 Nov 2026: Analysts raised targets after the results (Citigroup to $1,320, JPMorgan to $1,350, BMO to $1,250); no downgrades were found.",
                            "20 Nov 2026: The stock fell 4.89% (-7.7% for the week, per GuruFocus) in a broad sell-off of AI-infrastructure stocks. CNN reported the Nasdaq erased its 2026 gains, and Digital Realty fell as much as 6.6%.",
